%% Core request flow: designing guides behind the policy gate.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Bench scientist
    participant UI as Composer UI
    participant Core as packages/core
    participant Policy as Biosecurity engine
    participant API as /api/guides

    User->>UI: add gene cassette (orfCry ×2)
    UI->>Core: deriveTraits(genome)
    Core-->>UI: TraitVector (saturation applied)
    UI->>Policy: evaluateBiosafety(genome)
    Policy-->>UI: verdict=block (BS-01) + findings
    UI->>User: gate locked, remediation shown
    User->>UI: remove orfAero → re-evaluate
    UI->>Core: evaluateBiosafety(genome)
    Core-->>UI: verdict=allow
    User->>API: POST /api/guides { target: orfHsp }
    API->>Core: designGuides(genome, "orfHsp", 5)
    Core->>Core: scan assembled sequence for off-targets
    Core-->>API: ranked GuideCandidate[]
    API-->>User: 200 { ok: true, data: { guides } }
